&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryByCod DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryByCod :
OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK WHERE
           {&TableName}.cod-gr-cli >= v-ini-gr   AND
           {&TableName}.cod-gr-cli <= v-fim-gr   AND
           {&TableName}.cod-rep    >= v-ini-rep  AND
           {&TableName}.cod-rep    <= v-fim-rep.  

RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryGrupoCliente DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryGrupoCliente :
OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK
        WHERE {&TableName}.cod-gr-cli = v-cod-gr-cli
    .
    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

